<h1 class="h1" style="margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 26px; line-height: 32px; font-weight: bold; color: #2d3134">
	Verify your email
</h1>

<p style="margin: 0 0 24px 0">
	Hi <%= name %>, welcome to Tourly! Enter this code on the verification screen to activate your account and start
	booking tours.
</p>

<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="border-collapse: separate">
	<tr>
		<td align="center" style="padding: 24px 16px; background-color: #fff1e8; border: 1px solid #ffd2b5; border-radius: 12px">
			<div style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 16px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #c2410c">
				YOUR VERIFICATION CODE
			</div>
			<div
				class="code"
				style="padding: 10px 0 6px 10px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 40px; line-height: 48px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 10px; color: #2d3134"
			>
				<%= otp %>
			</div>
			<div style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #4a4e51">
				Expires in <strong><%= expiresInMinutes %> minutes</strong>
			</div>
		</td>
	</tr>
</table>

<p style="margin: 24px 0">
	Code expired? Go back to the verify screen and press <strong style="color: #2d3134">Resend code</strong>. Each new code
	replaces the old one.
</p>

<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="border-collapse: separate">
	<tr>
		<td style="padding: 14px 16px; background-color: #f7f7f7; border-radius: 10px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; color: #676a6c">
			<strong style="color: #2d3134">Didn't sign up?</strong> You can safely ignore this email. Tourly will never ask for
			this code by phone or message.
		</td>
	</tr>
</table>
